This is the Apple Notes decoder for "trivnote".
It is developed jointly with "trivnote" itself,
namely due to trivnote's direct utility to me
being a cheap substitute of Apple Notes that is
good enough to me.  While nobody should have to
familiarize themselves with the contents of this
repository, it may sometimes help to understand
why certain features in trivnote are implemented;
it is most certainly to preserve the good stuff
that I would miss dearly in days without iCloud.
